-`Φ(x) = c̄ (1 + i f'(x)) σ c₀ / √(1 + f'(x)²)` (`σ = ±1` the orientation). Since `γ` is the integral
-of its derivative, `γ' = Φ ∘ X` everywhere, which is Lipschitz.
